                                                "sense_id": "cd79e0dc-1465-3d72-8829-31842544bab8",
                                                "text": "After a ten-month layoff, during which extensive testing had taken place in conjunction with AEI, the 'Blue Trains' resumed full operation on October 2 1961, [...]."
